<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's net forex reserves dip $400 mln in Nov.</title>
<headline>Portugal's net forex reserves dip $400 mln in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal's net foreign exchange reserves, including gold valued at market prices, fell $400 million to 21.23 billion in November, the central bank said in its latest monthly review of the economy.</p>
<p>Over the first 11 months of the year, reserves rose $148 million.</p>
<p>--Lisbon newsroom 3511-3538254</p>
</text>
